From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 19:37:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 07706/11362] [outer-loop] ARC perception residuals fixed:
 mover void-FP + under-exploration (REQ-ARC-WMTE-5833)

- Adaptive exploration (pick next available action) -> all 8 games gather 50-60
  transitions (was 8 on r11l/ft09).
- Mover FP fixed via signal-strength bar (align>=0.7 over evidence>=4), not a
  compactness heuristic (rigid same-color match dropped ls20's MORPHING avatar;
  global density dropped avatars whose color is shared). Keeps sc25 (color-9,
  0.92/47) + ls20 (color-9, 1.0/59); cn04 now surfaces a real marker piece
  (color-8) instead of the color-0 void.
- HUD still 3/3 confusers (bp35/lf52/tu93). Minor residuals: sc25 meter, tu93 token.

9 unit tests + ruff + mypy clean. Next: end-to-end goal gate under detector perception.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
